/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is okay to mess up sometimes. Not everything goes as planned. Pull up your socks and prepare the harder topics like Harder DP, Graphs, N-ary trees, Trie, etc. You can still be shortlisted for good companies! In the end, this list will just help people get shortlisted and not placed. If you get shortlisted in companies, make sure you crack it till the very end. Have an astounding preparation when the placement drive starts.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
